 didn't! Its easy to remove. 10/10</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggm6NGcYVYT_text","label":"ggm6NGcYVYT_text","default":"Ricardo Garcia"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIKB6DSWp9_text","label":"ggIKB6DSWp9_text","default":"<p>Verified Buyer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLbs8pxQBv_text","label":"ggLbs8pxQBv_text","default":"Delighted on how well it works"},{"type":"html","id":"gglO-FrIDkk_text","label":"gglO-FrIDkk_text","default":"<p>I breath x10 times better with this and I feel like my sleep is way better since I put this on</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggenwThjKIL_text","label":"ggenwThjKIL_text","default":"Charles Gill"},{"type":"html","id":"ggX3g9lnm0o_text","label":"ggX3g9lnm0o_text","default":"<p>Verified Buyer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmaMW17iZg_text","label":"ggmaMW17iZg_text","default":"Breathing Made Easy"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvhDUe3kD8_text","label":"ggvhDUe3kD8_text","default":"<p>I've always struggled with nasal congestion at night, but these strips have changed everything. I can finally breathe clearly and sleep through the night!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyxqoGxZag_text","label":"ggyxqoGxZag_text","default":"Gerard"},{"type":"html","id":"ggj0PJFApve_text","label":"ggj0PJFApve_text","default":"<p>Verified Buyer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNh9dq25Q9_text","label":"ggNh9dq25Q9_text","default":"Helps me with allergies"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsWBVMQtmW_text","label":"ggsWBVMQtmW_text","default":"<p>These strips are a lifesaver during allergy season. They help open up my nasal passages and alleviate my nighttime stuffiness.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPRO7l_8bx_text","label":"ggPRO7l_8bx_text","default":"Sarah"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjqduIgVwU_text","label":"ggjqduIgVwU_text","default":"<p>Verified Buyer</p>"}],
